  "branch_triage_note": "Triaged 2026-08-17. 95 distinct findings when first recorded at 3c94c787; the extras since are (a) two numeric read-window constants in _scope_registry.py — CREDENTIAL_SNIFF_BYTES and CREDENTIAL_MAX_SNIFF_BYTES, sizes rather than secrets, and (b) synthetic fixture values in src/tests/unit/test_docview_credential_content_block.py, which became visible when the test tree stopped being excluded. None is real. EXPECT this list to grow when somebody adds a planted credential fixture: that is the cost of scanning the test tree, and it is the right trade — a planted fixture is cheap to triage, a real key pasted into a test is not cheap to miss.",
